    "pic": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9b0a7932f4f35e3f17cc13b56219a91f2a4dfd5e.jpg",
    "title": "中文已死：为什么我们越来越不敢好好说话？",
    "pubdate": 1792486800,
    "ctime": 1792485806,
    "desc": "对安全社交的依赖，让“玩梗”成了一种时代刚需。我们越来越习惯用最热闹的流行语，来掩饰最真实的情绪失语——看似什么都表达了，却又好像什么都没说......\n参考文献\n[1] CLARK H H, WILKES-GIBBS D. Referring as a collaborative process[J]. Cognition, 1986, 22(1): 1-39.\n[2] WILKES-GIBBS D, CLARK H H. Coordinating beliefs in conversation[J]. Journal of Memory and Language, 1992, 31(2): 183-194.\n[3] 汪航, 葛平平. 现代汉语程度副词“很”的来源及演变[J]. 语言研究, 2024, 44(3): 38-50.\n[4] WANG J, TAYLOR C. The conventionalisation of mock politeness in Chinese and British online forums[J]. Journal of Pragmatics, 2018, 142.\n[5] THURLOW C. From Statistical Panic to Moral Panic: The Metadiscursive Construction and Popular Exaggeration of New Media Language in the Print Media[J]. Journal of Computer-Mediated Communication, 2006, 11(3): 667-701.\n[6] 璩鑫圭, 唐良炎编. 学制演变/中国近代教育史资料汇编[M/OL]. 上海教育出版社, 2007.\n[7] SUSAN BLACKMORE. 模因机器[M/OL]. 机械工业出版社, 2022.",
    "desc_v2": [
      {
        "raw_text": "对安全社交的依赖，让“玩梗”成了一种时代刚需。我们越来越习惯用最热闹的流行语，来掩饰最真实的情绪失语——看似什么都表达了，却又好像什么都没说......\n参考文献\n[1] CLARK H H, WILKES-GIBBS D. Referring as a collaborative process[J]. Cognition, 1986, 22(1): 1-39.\n[2] WILKES-GIBBS D, CLARK H H. Coordinating beliefs in conversation[J]. Journal of Memory and Language, 1992, 31(2): 183-194.\n[3] 汪航, 葛平平. 现代汉语程度副词“很”的来源及演变[J]. 语言研究, 2024, 44(3): 38-50.\n[4] WANG J, TAYLOR C. The conventionalisation of mock politeness in Chinese and British online forums[J]. Journal of Pragmatics, 2018, 142.\n[5] THURLOW C. From Statistical Panic to Moral Panic: The Metadiscursive Construction and Popular Exaggeration of New Media Language in the Print Media[J]. Journal of Computer-Mediated Communication, 2006, 11(3): 667-701.\n[6] 璩鑫圭, 唐良炎编. 学制演变/中国近代教育史资料汇编[M/OL]. 上海教育出版社, 2007.\n[7] SUSAN BLACKMORE. 模因机器[M/OL]. 机械工业出版社, 2022.",
